---
// src/pages/index.astro
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Marrit Kim van der Staaij | 김여름</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    
    <header class="hero">
      <img src="/images/hero-bg.jpg" alt="Background" class="hero-bg" />
      <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
      <div class="hero-text">
        <h1>MARRIT KIM VAN DER STAAIJ</h1>
        <h2>김여름</h2>
        <p>Researcher . Writer . Advocate</p>
      </div>
      <div class="scroll-indicator">Scroll ↓</div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
      
      <section class="split-section">
        <div class="image-wrapper">
          <img src="/images/marrit-portrait.jpg" alt="Marrit Kim van der Staaij" class="portrait" />
        </div>
        <div class="text-wrapper">
          <h2 class="section-title">About</h2>
          <p>Marrit Kim van der Staaij / 김여름 is a Dutch-Korean researcher and writer based in Seoul, South Korea. With her background as chemical analyst and biomedical researcher, she looks at the world with the questions: "How does this work?" and "How can I contribute to this?" She brings this curiosity into her scientific work, storytelling, and advocacy for adoptees and their descendants. In this way, she hopes to create understanding and improvements in science and policies.</p>
          <p>Currently, she is writing a book about her journey as a Descendant of a Korean Adoptee (DoKAD), exploring the intergenerational impact of adoption, identity, and belonging. With a scientific background and a strong ethical focus, Marrit/여름 approaches her writing with an eye for detail and attention to connection and complexity.</p>
          <p>Through writing, advocacy, and research, she aims to contribute to greater recognition of (descendants of) adoptees and opening space for accountability, community, and healing.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="split-section reverse">
        <div class="text-wrapper bg-card">
          <span class="eyebrow">Upcoming Book</span>
          <h3 class="book-title">Traces of Freckles</h3>
          <p class="quote">"Back to the country that found my mother abandoned."</p>
          <p>An exploration of the intergenerational impact of adoption, identity, and belonging through the lens of a Descendant of a Korean Adoptee.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="image-wrapper">
          <img src="/images/book-cover.jpg" alt="The traces of freckles of my mother's mother" class="book-img" />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="center-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Projects</h2>
        <div class="grid-3">
          <a href="https://dokadarchive.wordpress.com/dokadstories/" target="_blank" class="card">
            <h3>Dokadstories</h3>
            <p>Archiving and sharing the stories of descendants of Korean adoptees.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/777706757533831/?ref=share" target="_blank" class="card">
            <h3>DoKAD Facebook Group</h3>
            <p>A dedicated community group for DoKAD members to connect and share.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="https://dokadarchive.wordpress.com/dokadarchive/information/f-4-12-visa-for-dokads/" target="_blank" class="card">
            <h3>F-4 Visa Guideline</h3>
            <p>Information and resources for navigating the F-4 visa process for descendants.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="center-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Media</h2>
        <div class="grid-2">
          <img src="/images/panel-dokad.png" alt="DoKAD Panel 2024" class="panel-img" />
          <img src="/images/panel-mosaic.png" alt="Adoption Mosaic Panel Talk" class="panel-img" />
        </div>
        
        <div class="links-card">
          <h3>Featured In (New to Old)</h3>
          <ul class="media-links">
            <li><a href="https://n.news.naver.com/article/003/0013233535" target="_blank">Naver News Feature</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://imnews.imbc.com/replay/straight/6710717_28993.html" target="_blank">MBC Straight Interview</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2zMyG2Z9a10&list=PLqQRuDoz8nbp_KA_pSsGyFjyFezHAEPPO&index=8" target="_blank">YouTube Panel Discussion</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.kmaeilsinbo.kr/news/articleView.html?idxno=358128" target="_blank">Korea Maeil Shinbo Article</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://frieschdagblad.nl/regio/Marrits-moeizame-zoektocht-naar-waar-haar-wortels-liggen-..." target="_blank">Friesch Dagblad (Dutch News)</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

  </body>
</html>

<style>
  /* --- GLOBAL VARIABLES & RESET --- */
  /* --- GLOBAL VARIABLES & RESET --- */
  :root {
    --bg-color: #fdfbf7; /* A warm, creamy paper-like white */
    --text-main: #222;
    --text-light: #444;
    --accent: #000;
    
    /* Freckle Colors (Soft, semi-transparent warm browns) */
    --freckle-1: rgba(160, 82, 45, 0.15); 
    --freckle-2: rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.1);  
    --freckle-3: rgba(205, 133, 63, 0.12); 
  }
  
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  body {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    background-color: var(--bg-color);
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.7;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    
    /* The Freckle Pattern */
    background-image: 
      radial-gradient(circle, var(--freckle-1) 1px, transparent 1.5px),
      radial-gradient(circle, var(--freckle-2) 1.5px, transparent 2px),
      radial-gradient(circle, var(--freckle-3) 1px, transparent 1.5px);
    background-size: 35px 35px, 55px 55px, 85px 85px;
    background-position: 0 0, 15px 25px, 45px 65px;
  }

  /* --- HERO SECTION --- */
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    width: 100vw;
    height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    color: white;
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .hero-text {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .hero-text h1 {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .hero-text h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    font-weight: 300;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .hero-text p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    padding-top: 10px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .scroll-indicator {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 40px;
    z-index: 3;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    animation: bounce 2s infinite;
  }

  @keyframes bounce {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
  }

  /* --- MAIN CONTENT CONTAINER --- */
  .container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 100px 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 120px;
  }

  /* --- TYPOGRAPHY --- */
  .section-title {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  /* --- LAYOUT STRUCTURES --- */
  .split-section {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 60px;
  }

  .split-section.reverse {
    flex-direction: row-reverse;
  }

  .image-wrapper {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .text-wrapper {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .center-section {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .center-section .section-title {
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  /* --- SPECIFIC ELEMENTS --- */
  .portrait {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    object-fit: cover;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
  }

  .bg-card {
    background: white;
    padding: 40px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    border: 1px solid #eee;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #888;
    font-weight: bold;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .book-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .quote {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }

  .book-img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 350px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  }

  /* --- GRIDS --- */
  .grid-3 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .grid-2 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .card {
    background: white;
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text-main);
    border: 1px solid #eee;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
    transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    text-align: left;
    display: block;
  }

  .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }

  .card h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .panel-img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }

  /* --- LISTS & LINKS --- */
  .links-card {
    background: white;
    padding: 40px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid #eee;
    text-align: left;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .links-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }

  .media-links {
    list-style: none;
  }

  .media-links li {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .media-links a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .media-links a:hover {
    color: #000;
    border-bottom-color: #000;
  }

  /* --- RESPONSIVE DESIGN FOR PHONES --- */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-text h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
    .split-section, .split-section.reverse { flex-direction: column; }
    .grid-3, .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .container { gap: 80px; padding: 60px 20px; }
  }
</style>